{"title":"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(probably_much_less_efficient_than_solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (probably much less efficient than solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tamara has three rows of two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-feet by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-feet flower beds in her garden. The beds are separated and also surrounded by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-foot-wide walkways, as shown on the diagram. What is the total area of the walkways, in square feet?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/3/3f3f120764dbcd2b3383097e2bf5010b26ee5619.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(0,10)--(15,10)--(15,0)--cycle); fill((0,0)--(0,10)--(15,10)--(15,0)--cycle, lightgray); draw((1,1)--(1,3)--(7,3)--(7,1)--cycle); fill((1,1)--(1,3)--(7,3)--(7,1)--cycle, white); draw((1,4)--(1,6)--(7,6)--(7,4)--cycle); fill((1,4)--(1,6)--(7,6)--(7,4)--cycle, white); draw((1,7)--(1,9)--(7,9)--(7,7)--cycle); fill((1,7)--(1,9)--(7,9)--(7,7)--cycle, white);  draw((8,1)--(8,3)--(14,3)--(14,1)--cycle); fill((8,1)--(8,3)--(14,3)--(14,1)--cycle, white); draw((8,4)--(8,6)--(14,6)--(14,4)--cycle); fill((8,4)--(8,6)--(14,6)--(14,4)--cycle, white); draw((8,7)--(8,9)--(14,9)--(14,7)--cycle); fill((8,7)--(8,9)--(14,9)--(14,7)--cycle, white);  defaultpen(fontsize(8, lineskip=1)); label(&quot;2&quot;, (1.2, 2)); label(&quot;6&quot;, (4, 1.2)); defaultpen(linewidth(.2)); draw((0,8)--(1,8), arrow=Arrows); draw((7,8)--(8,8), arrow=Arrows); draw((14,8)--(15,8), arrow=Arrows); draw((11,0)--(11,1), arrow=Arrows); draw((11,3)--(11,4), arrow=Arrows); draw((11,6)--(11,7), arrow=Arrows); label(&quot;1&quot;, (.5,7.8)); label(&quot;1&quot;, (7.5,7.8)); label(&quot;1&quot;, (14.5,7.8)); label(&quot;1&quot;, (10.8,.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;, (10.8,3.5)); label(&quot;1&quot;, (10.8,6.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"668\" height=\"445\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f9c9bce6576c287ee50d5628275c0a8b31b842.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 72\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 78\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 90\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 120\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Finding the area of the shaded walkway can be achieved by computing the total area of Tamara's garden and then subtracting the combined area of her six flower beds.\n</p><p>Since the width of Tamara's garden contains three margins, the total width is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/4/c647b236e40d8db29b8f1829704376c37df1414f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot 6+3\\cdot 1 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" /> feet.\n</p><p>Similarly, the height of Tamara's garden is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/e/ffe99fcd1197b910eb55feb56f65e1ca1f11818e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 2+4\\cdot 1 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"126\" height=\"14\" /> feet.\n</p><p>Therefore, the total area of the garden is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/2213c31419bb53b9ce775b9e33a08b13b0614384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\cdot 10 =150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> square feet.\n</p><p>Finally, since the six flower beds each have an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/1/4515127cbaee7d56f6f47e01b3fb8157ff762aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\cdot 6 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> square feet, the area we seek is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/e/6ae69451d974c3ec69133eb0085067e13dfa5af4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150 - 6\\cdot 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />, and our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/1/34181285142665cda173d169783f8b72baccb0a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28probably_much_less_efficient_than_solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(probably_much_less_efficient_than_solution_1)\">Solution 2 (probably much less efficient than solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (probably much less efficient than solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The long horizontal walkways have an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31ae5d4cb7de7162a4990424eb5f251dd903c3ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 ft^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"20\" /> each, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of them <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e6becba690c56eb670c2ca9ef2af50cbd0fd7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\longrightarrow 60 ft^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>The short vertical walkways have an area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/9/a4936de707361f73dee7d8b35bc37b58d9c63884.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 ft^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"20\" /> each, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of them <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f0ebedd2551e3d4b4a8993d2d96f595c9040790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\longrightarrow 18 ft^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Adding the areas together, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/c/ffc53bc2be0c6e1c33a18a5e6ab68503a681c440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 ft^{2} + 18 ft^{2} = 78 ft^{2} \\Longrightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"280\" height=\"30\" />.\n~JH. L\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/str7kmcRMY8\">https://youtu.be/str7kmcRMY8</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/B7UuRDIfXkQ\">https://youtu.be/B7UuRDIfXkQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A\">2017 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2017 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\